# 8. Notes design

Current design:

```text
notes
---------
note_id
stud_id
date
text
```

Your intended rule:

> **One optional note per student per date.**

Therefore:

```sql
UNIQUE (stud_id, date)
```

is appropriate.

You've also reasoned that Notes **shouldn't necessarily reference an Attendance row**, because a note can describe an entire day even when no attendance record exists.

For example:

```text
Aug 15
→ "College holiday"
```

There doesn't have to be an attendance record for that day.

### Notes API identification

You decided that:

```text
stud_id + date
```

is enough to identify the note.

So the frontend doesn't inherently need `note_id` for GET/PATCH/DELETE.

